[should-fix] No episode tells a learner who fell behind how to use the staged rds/ copies. setup.md:144
says rds/ is "for jumping into later episodes", but readRDS(paste0(work_dir, "<name>.rds")) reads
scrna_workshop/<name>.rds while the rsync puts the copies in scrna_workshop/rds/<name>.rds, so a cold
start fails with "cannot open compressed file". Add a short callout before each load-data chunk of
Episodes 4, 5, 6 and 8 (Episode 7 starts from SeuratData).
Apply: git apply updates-patches/05-cold-start-callouts.patch

